WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:35.920
Rafael, you’re in the wrong.

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:40.210
You should’ve never used The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:45.450
Did you need to turn your monsters evil and send them to the graveyard?

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:48.650
Just to satisfy Dartz's destiny?

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:51.560
In that case, I'll change destiny!

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:55.630
I’ll destroy the darkness in your heart with this card!

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:02.170
Strike the Heart's Darkness!

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:13.530
Yugi...

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:15.950
Yugi.

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:23.970
Where am I?

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:32.460
A graveyard?

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:39.910
I did activate the spell card, Underworld Circle to summon monsters from the graveyard.

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:42.910
But this is a real graveyard.

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:50.410
Rafael!

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:00.830
That boy is...

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:06.830
Rafael!

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:22.840
Wait!  Rafael!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:25.980
Rafael?

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:28.920
These are…

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.860
My family's graves.

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:33.270
What?

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.140
Dartz!

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:47.380
This is from my past!

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:50.370
We're looking at your memories?

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:53.810
You can run, but it ends the same, Rafael.

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:57.720
No matter where you go, you'll arrive here.

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:59.360
Do you know why?

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:05.120
Because you're scared to admit that your family is dead.

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:14.370
You're the only survivor of the shipwreck.

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:24.740
Brother!

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.310
Brother!

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:29.390
Sonia!  Julien!

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.420
Brother!

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:36.120
Sonia!  Julien!

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:53.400
Since you're alive, you think your family must also be alive.

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:56.340
But destiny only chose you.

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:59.340
Your family is dead.

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:05.770
If you won't accept that, you can never know destiny's answer.

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:10.190
By devoting yourself to destiny, you’ll start to know the answer.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:14.320
Now make it clear for yourself.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:17.630
That your family rests in that graveyard!

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:43.210
You must check for yourself if you want to leave here.

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:53.860
So this is what happened?

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:23.000
This can’t be true!

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:26.220
Your family went missing!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:57.230
Rafael, now begins your destiny.

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:13.210
Activate your destiny!

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:27.290
Devote yourself to your heart's darkness.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:29.090
Become one with it.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:30.960
Do it, Rafael.

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:34.400
The answer lies beyond.

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:03.830
Dreadscythe!

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:08.760
Your heart's darkness created that monster.

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:24.240
My destiny was decided that day.

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:30.290
By becoming one with my heart's darkness and devoting myself to destiny, I was saved.

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:32.040
Saved?

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:36.230
Then why did you resist sending  your monsters to the graveyard?

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:41.170
If you devoted yourself to destiny, you wouldn’t have cared!

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:45.170
Nameless Pharaoh, you know nothing about me.

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:51.170
I know you didn’t want your monsters to end up like your family!

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.620
That’s why you feared the graveyard!

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:56.610
That’s the real you!

00:08:56.610 --> 00:08:57.560
I…

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:01.570
I've overcome my heart's darkness.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:04.890
I can’t go back!

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:14.810
I can see them!

00:09:14.810 --> 00:09:16.100
Yugi!

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:25.410
Underworld Circle removes all monster cards in the deck from play.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:31.410
And we can Special Summon a monster from our graveyards each turn!

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:35.350
When this activates, all monsters on the field are destroyed!

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:39.030
My Dark Magician Girl was destroyed.

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:41.290
But why did Dreadscythe survive?

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:46.030
By sacrificing one card from my hand, Dreadscythe revives.

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:48.730
But I don't get to choose to do this.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:50.570
What do you mean?

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:53.540
Dreadscythe revives on its own!

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:54.510
What?

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:59.460
Even I can no longer get rid of Dreadscythe.

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:00.690
What?

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.440
A monster that can't be destroyed?

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:10.600
As long as Dreadscythe is on the field, you can't bring out another monster.

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:14.560
So you can’t revive monsters from your graveyard?

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:18.430
That's why I told you that I can't go back.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:22.000
My destiny is with Dreadscythe.

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:25.940
So I'll devote myself to this destiny!

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:29.870
Dreadscythe represents your heart's darkness.

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:33.870
If I don’t destroy it, you'll be...

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:37.520
Due to Underworld Circle's effect...

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:41.690
…I Special Summon Dark Magician from the graveyard in attack position!

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:44.320
He revived the dead.

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:49.120
If he can summon monsters from his graveyard, Yugi still has a chance!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:52.570
I set a card and end my turn.

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:54.730
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:54.730 --> 00:11:00.840
Due to Underworld Circle's effect, I Special Summon Jack's Knight in attack position!

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:06.540
He can Special Summon from the graveyard even during the opponent’s turn!

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:11.990
Nameless Pharaoh, I’ll engrave the power of darkness in your soul!

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:14.380
Dreadscythe attacks Dark Magician!

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:15.780
Forbidden Requiem!

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:18.950
I flip over my set card!

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:20.190
Zero Gravity!

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:32.500
This card switches all monsters in attack position to defense position.

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:37.440
Nice!  If all monsters are in defense position, they can't battle!

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:39.890
Are you sure?

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:41.040
What?

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:43.040
I flip over my set card!

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:44.980
Spirit Hunting!

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:49.920
This card switches my monster's battle position.

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:53.360
And destroys all your monsters in defense position.

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:54.730
Oh no!

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:18.610
Yugi!

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:21.720
His two monsters were destroyed easily!

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:23.720
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:29.760
Due to Underworld Circle, I Special Summon Dark Magician Girl from my graveyard in attack position!

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:33.630
Then I activate Altar of Restoration from my hand!

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:36.630
By removing the top two cards in my deck from play...

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:39.570
...I add a card from my graveyard to my hand.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:43.140
I select Eye of Timaeus!

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:53.480
I combine Timaeus and Dark Magician Girl!

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:57.390
Come out, Dark Magician Girl the Dragon Knight!

00:12:57.390 --> 00:13:04.080
Its ability lets you destroy a monster in exchange for one card in your hand.

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:07.170
But it won't work on Dreadscythe!

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:11.270
Dark Magician Girl the Dragon Knight attacks Dreadscythe!

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:14.180
Black Dragon Burst!

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:23.690
Did he destroy it?

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:32.720
You can't destroy Dreadscythe!

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:34.660
Why, Yugi?

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:38.160
You know attacking Dreadscythe is pointless.

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:41.090
I set a card and end my turn.

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:47.030
You’ll lose if you care about nonsense, such as trying to change his heart.

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:49.400
My turn.  I draw.

00:13:49.400 --> 00:13:51.470
Underworld Circle's effect activates!

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:56.910
I Special Summon Queen's Knight from my graveyard in attack position!

00:13:56.910 --> 00:14:00.850
I discard a card I drew this turn.

00:14:04.370 --> 00:14:07.410
To activate Orichalcos Sword of Sealing!

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:15.890
It stops Timaeus’s effect.

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:20.060
Dreadscythe, attack Dark Magician Girl the Dragon Knight!

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:22.100
Forbidden Requiem!

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:24.810
Yugi!

00:14:24.810 --> 00:14:26.480
It's over!

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:35.750
What?

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:40.620
I activated Reduction Barrier.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:45.560
It lowers the battle damage I take to 10%.

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:47.450
That saved him!

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:50.180
But he only has 10 life points left.

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:51.000
Yugi...

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:53.040
It's not over, Rafael!

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:57.680
If I have more than 0 life points, I won't give up!

00:14:57.680 --> 00:15:00.110
Don’t you get it, Nameless Pharaoh?

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:02.540
The battle's decided.

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:05.160
Destiny cannot change.

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:12.090
I’ll defeat destiny and your heart's darkness, along with that grotesque monster!

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:16.430
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:23.200
Underworld Circle lets me Special Summon Big Shield Gardna from my graveyard in defense position!

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:27.730
I activate Pot of Greed from my hand!

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:30.870
I draw two cards from my deck!

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:33.800
It’s finally here.

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:38.240
From my hand, I activate the spell card, Spider Web!

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:45.350
I can add a card that was sent to your graveyard a turn ago to my hand.

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:47.580
What are you planning to do?

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:52.370
The card you sent to the graveyard a turn ago was Monster Reborn.

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:59.010
If you can't show your heart's light to that monster, I'll show it to him for you!

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:00.740
Can it be?

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:05.020
I resurrect Guardian Eatos from the graveyard!

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:17.120
Eatos...

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:20.130
Yugi summoned Eatos?

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:21.570
Yugi...

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:23.530
And from my hand...

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:28.960
Jonouchi, lend my your strength.

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:31.470
I activate Claw of Hermos!

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:42.780
Jonouchi!  Yugi is using your Hermos!

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:46.180
I fuse Claw of Hermos and Queen's Knight!

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:51.530
I equip the Equip Spell, Goddess Bow on Eatos!

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:55.500
It gains 2500 attack points!

00:16:56.200 --> 00:17:02.410
Since Eatos is no longer in the graveyard, Dreadscythe loses 500 attack points!

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:06.060
Their attack points are equal.

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:08.060
Are you going for mutual destruction?

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:10.710
But Dreadscythe won't die!

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.440
Destiny won't change!

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:18.130
Rafael, remember the bond you have with your monsters and family!

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:22.280
That bond is the power to change destiny!

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:25.070
Sonia!

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:26.490
Happy birthday!

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:46.330
Eatos attacks Dreadscythe!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:47.710
Forbidden Psalm!

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:52.590
Goddess Bow's effect activates!

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:57.020
When your monster activates its effect during battle…

00:17:57.020 --> 00:18:01.390
...my monster can ignore the battle damage and attack again!

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:02.590
What?

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:11.360
I see!

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:15.400
If he has no cards in his hand, Dreadscythe can't resurrect!

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:24.510
Eatos!

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:36.070
I knew you'd call for Eatos in the end.

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:42.140
Your couldn’t become one with your heart's darkness.

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:49.770
To escape the reality of losing your family and being alone...

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:53.670
...you depended on destiny and Dartz.

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:57.960
Your heart's darkness is an illusion you created.

00:18:57.960 --> 00:19:00.490
Destiny isn't set.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.610
You make your destiny!

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:09.370
But The Seal of Orichalcos takes the loser’s soul.

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:13.050
This you cannot change.

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:14.490
Rafael!

00:19:14.490 --> 00:19:17.500
My turn!  I draw!

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:23.940
Due to Underworld Circle, I Special Summon Guardian Grarl from my graveyard in attack position.

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:25.640
A monster from your graveyard...

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:30.080
I activate Soul Charge from my hand.

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:34.910
I can Special Summon monsters from my graveyard.

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:37.380
So he's going to attack Yugi!

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:43.380
No.  The monsters Soul Charge summoned can’t attack this turn.

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:45.860
So what is Rafael doing?

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:49.970
There are no monsters left in my graveyard.

00:19:49.970 --> 00:19:51.860
Is this good?

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:54.270
Rafael, you…

00:19:54.270 --> 00:20:02.210
For every monster Soul Charge summons, I pay 500 life points.

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:06.260
Rafael!

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:18.890
Eatos...

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:32.770
Eatos!  Everyone!

00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:34.240
I caught you!

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:35.710
I caught you too!

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:37.380
Brother!

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:39.040
Brother!

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:07.790
Rafael!

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:10.960
The Seal is gone.

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:12.550
What's going on?

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:15.480
You did it, Yugi.

00:21:15.890 --> 00:21:19.650
Why didn't it steal my soul?

00:21:19.650 --> 00:21:25.850
The Seal of Orichalcos is the darkness in the controller's heart.

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:29.430
Darkness in the heart...  That means...

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:32.600
Your heart's darkness has vanished.

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:35.540
My heart's darkness vanished...

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:42.710
What’s going on?

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:44.640
This is...

00:21:58.970 --> 00:22:07.850
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:08.380 --> 00:22:16.220
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:27.380
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:36.870
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:37.470 --> 00:22:45.930
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:46.710 --> 00:22:51.440
I'll live feeling them

00:22:52.050 --> 00:22:56.590
For me to be me

00:22:56.590 --> 00:23:05.080
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:10.720
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:20.380
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:27.540
Rafael's Seal vanished?

00:23:27.540 --> 00:23:32.790
The Seal of Orichalcos is the heart's darkness.

00:23:32.790 --> 00:23:40.080
Rafael tells us Dartz's location, so we leave the crumbling Paradius to Doma's Shrine.

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:45.790
As bad omens spread, an unknown army appears before our helicopter.

00:23:45.790 --> 00:23:47.800
Is this also Doma's doing?

00:23:47.800 --> 00:23:52.400
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
To the Final Battle!
Dartz vs Yugi & Kaiba

00:23:52.400 --> 00:23:54.030
Duel, standby!
